# This file is used to exclude files from the Docker build context.
# A smaller context results in faster builds and a more secure image.

**/.dockerignore
**/.env

# Git files
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# IDE/Editor specific
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.sln.DotSettings.user
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# Build artifacts
**/bin
**/obj
**/charts
**/node_modules

# Test results, coverage reports, and benchmark artifacts
**/TestResults/
**/coverage-report
**/coverage-summary
**/badges
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts

# Documentation and local scripts
*.md
scripts/